  Rules_Klondike: "\xB7 Stack cards by alternating colors in descending order.\n\xB7
    Only Ks can occupy empty spaces.\n\xB7 Stack cards by suit in ascending order
    in the four foundations from A to K to win."
  Rules_Sawayama: "\xB7 Stack cards by alternating colors in descending order.\n\xB7
    Any card can occupy empty spaces.\n\xB7 After drawing all cards from the stock,
    you can use the remaining empty space to place one card.\n\xB7 Stack cards by
    suit in ascending order in the four foundations from A to K to win."
  Rules_FreeCell: "\xB7 Stack cards by alternating colors in descending order.\n\xB7
    Any card can occupy empty spaces.\n\xB7 Are there enough free spaces to move
    a stack card by card? If not, you can't move that stack!\n\xB7 Stack cards by
    suit in ascending order in the four foundations from A to K to win."
  Rules_Spider: "\xB7 Stack cards by descending order, regardless of suit.\n\xB7
    To move stacks, they must only have one suit!\n\xB7 Any card can occupy empty
    spaces.\n\xB7 To draw more cards from the stock, there cannot be empty spaces.\n\xB7
    Form eight ordered stacks of a single suit from K to A to win."
